# Generated from data/ by `python3 -m engine.report`. The recorder rewrites them on every
# commit, so a local run and a CI run conflict on every line. They are never merged by
# hand: regenerate instead. Marked non-diffable to keep the noise out of reviews.
site/data/*.json -diff linguist-generated

# Resolve conflicts in the generated board data by taking either side. Both are
# regenerated from data/ by `python3 -m engine.report`, the recorder rewrites them every
# ten minutes, and hand-merging two machine-written JSON files is never the right answer.
# Requires the local driver configured in scripts/setup-git.sh.
site/data/*.json merge=regen
